<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="01">
<name>Engine</name>
<section id="10006_S000J" variety="S000J">
<name>Engine Control</name>
<ttl id="10006_S000J_744E7_T004T" variety="T004T">
<name>EFI System (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="X39400000RG04IC" category="C" type-id="302J7" name-id="064PP-02" from="200912">
<dtccode>P0604/89</dtccode>
<dtcname>RAM malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>P0606/89</dtccode>
<dtcname>ECU Internal Malfunction 1</dtcname>
<dtccode>P060A/89</dtccode>
<dtcname>Monitoring CPU Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>P060D/89</dtccode>
<dtcname>Accelerator Sensor Input Circuit Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>P060E/89</dtccode>
<dtcname>Throttle Sensor Brake SW Input Circuit Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>P0657/89</dtccode>
<dtcname>Actuator Power Supply Circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="X39400000RG04IC_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I2R00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>When this DTC is stored, the engine control computer cuts off the current to the throttle motor, and the throttle valve is returned to a specified opening angle by the return spring.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="1.498008     in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="3.154628     in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="2.494272     in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC NO.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Malfunction Duration</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Others</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Item</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P0604/89</ptxt>
<ptxt>P0606/89</ptxt>
<ptxt>P060A/89</ptxt>
<ptxt>P060D/89</ptxt>
<ptxt>P060E/89</ptxt>
<ptxt>P0657/89</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine control computer internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RG04IC_11" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RG04IC_12" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000RG04IC_12_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I2T00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RG04IC_12_0001" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RG04IC_12_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000I2S00000">
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Perform a road test.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs by following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000CCX015X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="C02" colwidth="3.04in"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="C03" colwidth="1.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC is displayed again</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Another DTC is displayed again</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Normal code displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If DTCs other than P0604/89, P0606/89, P060A/89, P060D/89, P060E/89 or P0657/89 are output, troubleshoot those DTCs first.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RG04IC_12_0002" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000RG04IC_12_0003" fin="true">B</right>
<right ref="X39400000RG04IC_12_0004" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RG04IC_12_0002">
<testtitle>Replace Engine Control Computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000020V0005X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RG04IC_12_0003">
<testtitle>Go to Related DTC Chart<xref label="Seep01" href="X39400000QT041D"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RG04IC_12_0004">
<testtitle>Inspection for Intermittent Problems<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CD101FX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
